{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Knot.BlockGeneratingFunction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Knot.BlockGeneratingFunction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Knot.BodyOrderExpansion","lean:module:QOU.Knot.BlockLengthAdditive"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.BlockGeneratingFunction.gf_blocks_pow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.BlockGeneratingFunction.gf_blocks_pow","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/BlockGeneratingFunction.lean#L105-L116","doc":"The identical-block corollary: `A` copies of one block give `G_1(x)^A`,\nnow with the degree being the length of the assembled word rather than an\nassumed sum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.BlockGeneratingFunction.gf_blocks","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.BlockGeneratingFunction.gf_blocks","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/BlockGeneratingFunction.lean#L86-L103","doc":"**The block factorisation.** Grading by the Coxeter length of the assembled\n`A`-nucleon word, the generating function is the product of the per-nucleon\ngenerating functions.\n\nThe left-hand degree is `ℓ` of a single permutation in `S_m`; the right-hand\nside is a product over `A` independent blocks. They agree because length is\nadditive across an order-separated split, which is the parabolic length formula\nof `BlockLengthAdditive`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.BlockGeneratingFunction.length_ofFin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.BlockGeneratingFunction.length_ofFin","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/BlockGeneratingFunction.lean#L69-L84","doc":"**The Coxeter length of the assembled word is the sum of the blocks'\nlengths.** This is `length_blockProd_of_supportedIn` transported to a `Fin A`\nfamily: the extension by the identity is supported everywhere vacuously, so the\nhypothesis is only a condition on the `A` real blocks. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.BlockGeneratingFunction.ofFin_ge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.BlockGeneratingFunction.ofFin_ge","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/BlockGeneratingFunction.lean#L66-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.BlockGeneratingFunction.ofFin_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.BlockGeneratingFunction.ofFin_lt","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/BlockGeneratingFunction.lean#L63-L64","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.BlockGeneratingFunction.ofFin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.BlockGeneratingFunction.ofFin","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/BlockGeneratingFunction.lean#L58-L61","doc":"Extend an `A`-indexed family of blocks to all of `ℕ` by the identity, so it\ncan be fed to `blockProd`. Blocks past `A` contribute nothing. ","signatureChunk":0}]}